        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5011 Square Knob With 5058 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass, this square knob comes with a matching rose. Its unique shape will enhance any contemporary setting and people will take notice of its modern flair. It will fit 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin Square 5011 Knob With Matching 5058 Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" standard door preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Contemporary Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2.625\" (squared)</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.4\" (squared)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button. An emergency release function allows the knob to automatically unlock when it is turned from the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Square Knob With Matching Rose, Baldwin 5011",
                "description": "Baldwin Estates Collection 5011 Contemporary Square Knob With 5058 Rosette - Made of solid brass, this square knob comes with a matching rose. Its unique shape will enhance any contemporary setting and people will take notice of its modern flair. It will fit 1-3/8 inches and 1-3/4 inches door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
